"Lets a web browser control VLC. Set its password in the Advanced Options."
msgstr ""
"Omogućuje web-pregledniku upravljanje VLC-om. Zaporku postavite u naprednim "
"mogućnostima."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1232
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:352
msgid "Video post-processing"
msgstr "Završna obrada slike"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1233
msgid ""
"Improves the picture of poorly encoded videos, at the cost of processing "
"power."
msgstr "Poboljšava sliku loše kodiranih videa, po cijenu procesorske snage."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1282
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:239
